#: docs/reference/formAtom.md
msgid "Subscribe to one native RHF field value as a read-only Jotai atom."
msgstr "Подписаться на значение одного RHF-поля через read-only атом Jotai."

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
